# The scene bank is 386 MB of cached synthesis and the checkpoints are 17 MB.
# Both are reproducible: synth.py rebuilds the bank in about seven minutes and
# train.py rebuilds the weights from it. What ships is the 2.9 MB ONNX in
# psr/model, which is the only artefact the page actually loads.
bank/
runs/
# …except the trained checkpoint itself, which is force-added: it is what the
# ONNX was exported from, and without it nobody can continue training or verify
# the export.
!runs/psrnet_best.pt
train.log
__pycache__/
